    "name": "Kingdom's Life",
    "steam_appid": 1847600,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Build! </h2></strong><br><br>You will find 29 types of buildings, each of which produces goods and participates in the life of your country. Build production chains to produce complex goods<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847600/extras/e3d32b6caa742de1163130bee092f58f.avif?t=1753025556\" /></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Develop your lands! </h2></strong><br><br>You have to create a state from scratch, starting with one detachment of settlers. Gradually, you will grow, develop, and become stronger.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847600/extras/251b0dc77175fe231b3537b42c03d92b.avif?t=1753025556\" /></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Resources! </h2></strong><br><br>There are 25 types of resources in the game. Food is consumed by the population, materials are needed for construction and complex production, and weapons are needed for soldiers.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847600/extras/5ac2bebcee6db864b2cc14c3f5736d7e.avif?t=1753025556\" /></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Divide and Conquer! </h2></strong><br><br>The game has an advanced diplomacy system. Make alliances, fight, fuel discontent, invest. Prove that you are a worthy ruler!<br><br>If there is no gain, do not move; if you cannot gain, do not use troops; if there is no danger, do not fight. The sovereign should not take up arms because of his anger; the commander should not engage in battle because of his anger.<br><i>(C) Sun Tzu</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847600/extras/3a4c4eebefdd17907df9982d81bd8188.poster.avif?t=1753025556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847600/extras/3a4c4eebefdd17907df9982d81bd8188.webm?t=1753025556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847600/extras/3a4c4eebefdd17907df9982d81bd8188.mp4?t=1753025556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Technologies! </h2></strong><br><br>117 technologies and 4 conditional stages of society development are waiting for you: Tribal system, feudalism, capitalism, industrialism.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847600/extras/6cc511595e4faf24abcbd60d20a6199c.avif?t=1753025556\" /></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Develop economy! </h2></strong><br><br>Keep track of the parameters of your economy. Build production, allocate resources, subsidize private business. The game combines simplicity and depth of economy. Become successful!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847600/extras/b8484eda71d3086817338ec2d561ac48.avif?t=1753025556\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Build! </h2></strong><br><br>You will find 29 types of buildings, each of which produces goods and participates in the life of your country. Build production chains to produce complex goods<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847600/extras/e3d32b6caa742de1163130bee092f58f.avif?t=1753025556\" /></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Develop your lands! </h2></strong><br><br>You have to create a state from scratch, starting with one detachment of settlers. Gradually, you will grow, develop, and become stronger.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847600/extras/251b0dc77175fe231b3537b42c03d92b.avif?t=1753025556\" /></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Resources! </h2></strong><br><br>There are 25 types of resources in the game. Food is consumed by the population, materials are needed for construction and complex production, and weapons are needed for soldiers.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847600/extras/5ac2bebcee6db864b2cc14c3f5736d7e.avif?t=1753025556\" /></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Divide and Conquer! </h2></strong><br><br>The game has an advanced diplomacy system. Make alliances, fight, fuel discontent, invest. Prove that you are a worthy ruler!<br><br>If there is no gain, do not move; if you cannot gain, do not use troops; if there is no danger, do not fight. The sovereign should not take up arms because of his anger; the commander should not engage in battle because of his anger.<br><i>(C) Sun Tzu</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847600/extras/3a4c4eebefdd17907df9982d81bd8188.poster.avif?t=1753025556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847600/extras/3a4c4eebefdd17907df9982d81bd8188.webm?t=1753025556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847600/extras/3a4c4eebefdd17907df9982d81bd8188.mp4?t=1753025556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Technologies! </h2></strong><br><br>117 technologies and 4 conditional stages of society development are waiting for you: Tribal system, feudalism, capitalism, industrialism.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847600/extras/6cc511595e4faf24abcbd60d20a6199c.avif?t=1753025556\" /></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Develop economy! </h2></strong><br><br>Keep track of the parameters of your economy. Build production, allocate resources, subsidize private business. The game combines simplicity and depth of economy. Become successful!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847600/extras/b8484eda71d3086817338ec2d561ac48.avif?t=1753025556\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Kingdom's Life - Large turn-based global strategy game in pixel style. You have to create your own people and state. Can you lead the state to political, economic, technological and military triumph? It depends on you.",
